			(property "Description" "Adafruit #5807 USB-C PD sink breakout (HUSB238). Header pins 1-6 left to right, USB-C facing away: SDA, SCL, V+, GND, D-, D+. Pins 7/8 = 3.5mm terminal block +/-. V+ is live at 5V immediately on plug-in, before PD negotiation."
